Subject: Backport the upstream fixes of the bug72333 test

The test came with the backport of the fix for bug #72333 in its first
version, in which the server stops reading before the client has written
everything. Take the later upstream fixes of the test: commits f0e67d1a56d
("Speed up test for bug72333"), 0c8ad36d924 ("Make test for bug #72333 a
bit more reliable"), 53e2c9158d4 ("Consume data by server in test for bug
#72333") and 6d066dc421e ("Lower timeout in test for but #72333"), all in
PHP 7.0.18.
---
 ext/openssl/tests/bug72333.phpt | 79 ++++++++++++++++++++++++-----------------
